  "description": "Extends the Umbraco 17 backoffice Dictionary section filter to also match translation VALUES, not just dictionary-item names. Useful for editors who remember a translated string but not the dictionary key. Adds one authenticated Management API endpoint and a backoffice entry point that re-points the built-in Dictionary collection's data source at it — no window.fetch patching, no anonymous endpoints.",
